---
// Sum1 -> Sum2 -> Sum3 -> Sum4 code-to-pprof trace cutting 7.5x latency.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="ge8b">
  <div class="ge8b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Progressive bottleneck removal across Sum1, Sum2, Sum3, and Sum4 cutting latency from 101ms down to 13.6ms on 2 million integer lines by eliminating bytes.Split, string copying, and generic ParseInt checks.">
      {/* 4 sequential pipeline stages */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="204" height="256" rx="10" class="ge8b-card is-red" />
      <text x="28" y="42" class="ge8b-b-red">Sum1 (Baseline)</text>
      <text x="28" y="62" class="ge8b-m">bytes.Split + strconv</text>
      <rect x="28" y="76" width="176" height="64" rx="6" class="ge8b-box" />
      <text x="38" y="96" class="ge8b-b">101 ms · 60.8 MB</text>
      <text x="38" y="114" class="ge8b-m">1.60M allocs / op</text>
      <text x="38" y="130" class="ge8b-b-red">50.5 ns/line (FAIL)</text>
      <text x="28" y="164" class="ge8b-b">pprof #1 Bottleneck:</text>
      <text x="28" y="182" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>bytes.genSplit allocates a</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>bytes.genSplit xin mảng 2</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="198" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>huge [][]byte slice-of-slices</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>chiều [][]byte chứa 2 triệu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="28" y="214" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>(78.6% of total heap).</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>phần tử (78,6% heap!).</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="220" y1="140" x2="232" y2="140" class="ge8b-wire" />
      <polygon points="236,140 229,136 229,144" class="ge8b-head" />

      <rect x="236" y="16" width="204" height="256" rx="10" class="ge8b-card" />
      <text x="250" y="42" class="ge8b-b">Sum2 (In-place \n)</text>
      <text x="250" y="62" class="ge8b-m">Scan b[last:i] loop</text>
      <rect x="250" y="76" width="176" height="64" rx="6" class="ge8b-box" />
      <text x="260" y="96" class="ge8b-b">50 ms · 12.8 MB</text>
      <text x="260" y="114" class="ge8b-m">-50% time, -78% RAM</text>
      <text x="260" y="130" class="ge8b-b-red">25.0 ns/line (FAIL)</text>
      <text x="250" y="164" class="ge8b-b">pprof #2 Bottleneck:</text>
      <text x="250" y="182" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>runtime.slicebytetostring</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh ép string(b[last:i])</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="198" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>copies every line's bytes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>copy lại toàn bộ từng dòng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="250" y="214" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>for immutable string input.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>lên heap tới 2 triệu lần.</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="442" y1="140" x2="454" y2="140" class="ge8b-wire" />
      <polygon points="458,140 451,136 451,144" class="ge8b-head" />

      <rect x="458" y="16" width="204" height="256" rx="10" class="ge8b-card" />
      <text x="472" y="42" class="ge8b-b">Sum3 (unsafe string)</text>
      <text x="472" y="62" class="ge8b-m">zeroCopyToString(b)</text>
      <rect x="472" y="76" width="176" height="64" rx="6" class="ge8b-box" />
      <text x="482" y="96" class="ge8b-b">25.5 ms · 7.2 MB</text>
      <text x="482" y="114" class="ge8b-m">0 inner heap allocs</text>
      <text x="482" y="130" class="ge8b-b-red">12.7 ns/line (close!)</text>
      <text x="472" y="164" class="ge8b-b">pprof #3 Bottleneck:</text>
      <text x="472" y="182" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>strconv.ParseInt uses 72.6%</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>strconv.ParseInt ngốn 72,6%</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="198" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>of CPU handling base-N &amp;</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>CPU vì phải kiểm tra mọi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="472" y="214" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>empty checks we don't need.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>hệ cơ số tổng quát dư thừa.</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="664" y1="140" x2="676" y2="140" class="ge8b-wire-ok" />
      <polygon points="680,140 673,136 673,144" class="ge8b-head-ok" />

      <rect x="680" y="16" width="206" height="256" rx="10" class="ge8b-card is-ok" />
      <text x="694" y="42" class="ge8b-b-ok">Sum4 (Custom Parse)</text>
      <text x="694" y="62" class="ge8b-m">ParseInt(b[last:i])</text>
      <rect x="694" y="76" width="178" height="64" rx="6" class="ge8b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="704" y="96" class="ge8b-b-ok">13.6 ms · 7.2 MB</text>
      <text x="704" y="114" class="ge8b-m">Safe Go (no unsafe!)</text>
      <text x="704" y="130" class="ge8b-b-ok">6.9 ns/line (PASS!)</text>
      <text x="694" y="164" class="ge8b-b-ok">7.4x faster end-to-end:</text>
      <text x="694" y="182" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Parsing []byte directly</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc thẳng từ []byte vừa</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="198" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>even deleted unsafe code</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>nhanh hơn 7,4x vừa vứt</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="694" y="214" class="ge8b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>while beating &lt;=10 ns RAER.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>được mẹo unsafe, đạt RAER!</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Reference benchmark progression on 2M integer lines: each optimization targets the #1 bottleneck revealed by pprof—ultimately making unsafe zero-copy string hacks obsolete cleanly.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chuỗi tối ưu hóa theo số liệu pprof trên 2 triệu dòng số nguyên: xử lý đúng nút thắt số 1 ở mỗi vòng cuối cùng giúp code vừa nhanh gấp 7,4 lần vừa bỏ được mẹo unsafe.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge8b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge8b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge8b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge8b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge8b-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge8b-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .ge8b-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8b-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.1; }
  .ge8b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .ge8b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .ge8b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); font-size: 12.5px; }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge8b-wire { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .ge8b-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ge8b-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ge8b-head-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8b-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge8b-head-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge8b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
